# Build context is the repo root (both Dockerfiles COPY workspace manifests
# from here). Keep the context lean and reproducible: never ship host
# node_modules or prior build output into the image — they are reinstalled and
# rebuilt inside the Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-test
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# Never bake secrets into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS / editor / OS noise.
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store

# Planning docs are gitignored anyway, but exclude other markdown from the
# context so doc edits don't bust the Docker build cache.
*.md
!DEPLOY.md
